  "bio": {
    "eyebrow": "About Dr Mangahis",
    "heading_lead": "Meet",
    "heading_warm": "Dr Mangahis.",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dr Jaison Mangahis is an independent Consultant Specialist GP (ABN: 28 624 840 393) (MED0001651494) consulting at the Earlwood centre.",
      "Dr Mangahis has undertaken three years of extensive studies in Internal Medicine in the Philippines. He was awarded the White Coat Award for Professionalism and Ethical Practice of Medicine by the University of Santo Tomas Hospital. Dr Mangahis then moved to Australia and worked in several hospitals in Sydney, e.g., Liverpool Hospitals Network. He has worked in various hospital teams, including General Medicine, Cardiology, Palliative Care, Medical Oncology, Rheumatology and Immunology, Geriatrics, Respiratory Medicine, Renal Medicine, Gastroenterology, and Infectious Diseases. He also has a Certificate in Primary Care Dermatology and Skin Cancer Medicine and holds a Diploma in Child Health.",
      "Dr Mangahis speaks Tagalog in addition to English."
    ]
  },
